					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-342026#post-1333336</guid>
				<title>Re: Thank you</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-342026/scp-7560-j#post-1333336</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 22 Dec 2011 14:25:50 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Drewbear</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>301632</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Thank you, Voct. I hadn't commented on this because it made me very uncomfortable, in a bad way. I am friends with several people who have paranoid schizophrenics in their families, and I occasionally have to interview actively hallucinating schizophrenics as part of my job. It's very, very sad, the amount of confusion and pain that these people endure daily.</p> <p>One of the bad things is that, although there is medication that can help the hallucinations and delusions (at least somewhat), it's part of the pathology that schizophrenics frequently go off the meds because they don't think they need them. Their hallucinations/delusions are the TRUTH, after all.</p> <p>And just in general, I find making fun of/mocking someone BECAUSE of their mental illness, of whatever kind, to be in incredibly poor taste.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
